    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 MAUDLIN Street, KELLS—\r\n3 Maudlin Road presents an excellent opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom townhouse in a highly convenient location, with a range of amenities and recreational facilities within walking distance.\r\nWhile the property would benefit from modernisation, it offers a practical layout with well-proportioned rooms, providing an excellent blank canvas.\r\nTo the rear, the property boasts a generous garden, offering ample outdoor space with excellent development potential, subject to planning permission. The existing outbuildings also provide valuable additional storage space. Off-street parking is also available.\r\nThe property also qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant.\r\nIdeally situated close to local amenities, shops, services and recreational facilities, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families and investors alike.\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential this property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\nThis property comprises a spacious tiled entrance hall, a living room and reception\r\nroom both featuring open fire stoves. The dining area provide access to a fitted\r\nkitchen, complete with wall & floor kitchen units and integrated appliances.\r\nA fully tiled guest bathroom is located on the ground floor and includes a bath and\r\na separate walk-in shower. The first floor accommodates three double bedrooms .\r\nTo the rear of the property are several outbuildings, providing additional storage\r\nspace."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Convenient town center location\r\n• Large back garden\r\n• Accommodation in need of refurbishment\r\n• Option to extend (subject to PP)\r\n• OFCH and mains services\r\n• All amenities on your doorstep\r\n• Great commuter location"
      },
      {
